<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Jammu and Kashmir are pursuing 65 foreign terrorists while the Union Home Secretary and the IB Director are scheduled to visit for a security review. In Manipur, spurious liquor deaths have risen to 20 and nine arrested persons remain in police custody. In Chhattisgarh, authorities seized a cash dump of 39.77 lakh rupees and Maoist weapons and two Maoists surrendered after a bounty was placed on one. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/26/are-trumps-tariffs-aimed-at-securing-us-friendly-trade-deals?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOa1ZoampZM0RtdnZqUUJ6TDR3V1FrWEZQX2t4WXgydm1xM0ZaRlc4enJhd3BRQmQ2LTVkcU1OSVNieU4wQXZKZTFsSXoxUi12R0dLQlhMalg3OEl6STgwSkgxRWhpOTZxbE1jOHB5SHlNR2V6NWFkajR2SURYX1ljTjFCTnhicC1NYU84TVYzaVRJOG5yVVpTd2dBMTJKajF0WTJqRDF4ZlVnZ0plQ3lCa2JNVEJteU1mRTVYU2FUV0pDMW9R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Live&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQUVpBSGZfdjh5ZkVpajUwYlVjU2xpeEwwUjJxSFFOclhqOHQtX1pmdHIycmk4QXl6Tng0REU3aVVrdzJEMG1Pb0oyZC1xZFNuVk5Deks0WUMzZ1FzSWRvekNKWGZSMm9aVEZBYUtjQzZkMWQzbF9sTXBCbElxQXNfcnNVa3BYRGpfQ2pmU2ktWU5BNW1tNjVTa0FxTnZzblNx?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPMW8yQVk4YXEwNm5aeHFVaUpNb1Nfa0NnQ1dDaXd3aTFsbnVSTUxFRk85ei0zc3d6MHotTTAzVXA3a2JNUGxSbmRVZ3hrLThiVmZrWHNoNmFKZVVDZE9HVXFfOURlZVBnNXl2RXVlVm5LaVN1Sk9kSlRXbm9OeHJ5YlFBZ09SdVRDbWVZaDMteENUZHJuQlpCeG9wU1RDaHlYQUJfVTB1S0t2OF9WU21NNllB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Menafn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOVXRYSTlEOEEy